%% Weekend 2.0 - Text chat request flow on Google Cloud (DESIGN.md section 5.3, v0.2.0)
sequenceDiagram
  participant P as PWA phone
  participant N as Entry node
  participant A as API Cloud Run
  participant M as Firestore
  participant L as Claude Vertex AI
  participant T as Tool Calendar
  P->>N: POST /chat over tailnet
  N->>A: forward with ID token
  A->>A: verify passkey session and rate limit
  A->>M: fetch history and top-k memories
  A->>L: prompt with memories and history
  L-->>A: tool_use calendar.list_events
  A->>T: call with read-only token
  T-->>A: events
  A->>L: tool_result
  L-->>A: answer
  A-->>N: answer
  N-->>P: answer
  A->>M: save turn, memories, audit entry
